ed line -1, which isn't a line of this file, so this is on the nearest line in the diff._\\n\\nBefore it.\",\"line\":9,\"path\":\"thirty.txt\",\"side\":\"RIGHT\"}],\"commit_id\":\"abc123\",\"event\":\"COMMENT\"}"
